  "en": {
    "agenda": {
      "desktop": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" style=\"height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 420\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"nv6-agenda-en-desktop-title nv6-agenda-en-desktop-desc\" xml:lang=\"en\" data-kind=\"agenda\" data-variant=\"desktop\"><title id=\"nv6-agenda-en-desktop-title\">Congress lays out its requested testimony calendar</title><desc id=\"nv6-agenda-en-desktop-desc\">Congressional requests published in November 2026, spaced editorially. House lawmakers request closed-door transcribed interviews with Jensen Huang on 1 December and Tim Teter on 2 December, and a hearing with Jeffrey Kessler on 3 December. The Senate Banking Committee requests Huang on 3 December and Howard Lutnick on 10 December. Lutnick agreed to participate voluntarily; acceptance of the requested date remains unestablished. Huang and Teter are asked to confirm by 13 November at 8 pm EST, equivalent to 14 November at 1 am UTC and 2 am in Paris; a subpoena is announced if confirmation is not received. This conditional branch concerns Huang and Teter only.</desc><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"798\" height=\"418\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"var(--color-surface)\" stroke=\"var(--color-line-strong)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"33\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Congress\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--color-paper)\" data-zone=\"header\">Congress lays out its requested testimony calendar</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"l0g Nvidia Congress\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"var(--color-muted)\" data-zone=\"header\">December 2026 · requested dates</text><path d=\"M33 93L54 93L66 105L66 139L33 139Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M54 93L54 105L66 105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"11